{
  "_comment": [
    "Build scopes for .github/workflows/release.yml.",
    "'all' is every target the release matrix has ever shipped (27).",
    "'linux' is the handful actually deployed on nodes: amd64, arm64, armv7.",
    "The workflow's default scope is 'auto': 'all' when publishing a release,",
    "'linux' for a plain manual build, which keeps 24 idle cross-compiles and",
    "~870 MiB of unread artifacts off the Actions bill."
  ],
